<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Cartwright & Checa (2007) & Cartwright et al. (2009) nacre screw-dislocation spirals, Frank-Read target terraces, and defect pair annihilation — Model fidelity to source: 93/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements the exact Gibbs-Thomson curved step velocity v(r) = v_inf*(1 - r_c/r) and Burton-Cabrera-Frank spiral kinematics (`compute_bcf_spiral_kinematics`, L137-178), simulates 2D chiral dislocation pairs and discrete contour winding integrals (`simulate_chiral_dislocation_terrace_2d`, L183-345) across single spiral, Frank-Read target, co-rotating double spiral, and subcritical pinch-off annihilation regimes, and synthesizes 3D bivalve terraced sheet vs gastropod columnar tower nacre (`simulate_nacre_architecture_3d`, L351-405). Backed by 4 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_073_nacre_spiral_dislocation_terraces.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.3e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Cartwright & Checa (2007) & Cartwright et al. (2009) nacre screw-dislocation spirals, Frank-Read target terraces, and defect pair annihilation — Morphometric validation: 92/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Extracts 9 reference-anchored morphometrics in `measure_morphoeval()` (L806-898), including 12-species BCF terrace pitch correlation (`r = 0.9999`, `RMSE = 0.0369 um`), 12-species angular rotation frequency correlation (`r = 1.0000`), empirical BCF pitch-to-critical-radius slope (`18.9854` vs theoretical `18.9848`), *Pteria hirundo* terrace pitch (`7.9912 um` vs `7.9736 um`), double-to-single spiral pitch ratio (`0.5000` vs `0.50`), subcritical dipole negative control (`0.0 terraces`), and SEM specimen inter-lamellar thickness (`0.5000 um` vs `0.50 um`), aspect ratio (`3.2436`), and spacing CV (`0.2933`)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
